@startuml seq-click-toggle
' 클릭 한 번 → 셀 토글(또는 치료) → 화면 다시 그리기
' 기준: refactor/base ef8ee24. 모두 Swing 이벤트 스레드(EDT)에서 실행된다.
' ui/BoardPanel.java:48-63, ui/GridCoordinateMapper.java, application/GameController.java:56-60,107-113
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox

actor "사용자" as User
participant "BoardPanel\n(MouseAdapter)" as Mouse
participant "GridCoordinateMapper" as Mapper
participant "GameController" as Controller
participant "CompositeBoard\n(Board)" as Board
participant "CancerGame" as Cancer
participant "BoardPanel\n(GameListener)" as Listener
participant "BoardRenderer" as Renderer

User -> Mouse : mousePressed(x, y)
activate Mouse
Mouse -> Mapper : cellAt(outermostCell, point, bounds)
Mapper --> Mouse : CellPosition(row, column)
note right of Mapper : 008: 행·열을 뒤집지 않고\nCellPosition으로 받는다

alt 왼쪽 클릭
  Mouse -> Controller : toggle(row, column)
  activate Controller
  Controller -> Board : toggle(CellPosition)  [synchronized(lock)]
  Controller -> Listener : boardChanged(EDITED)
  deactivate Controller
else 오른쪽 클릭 (#60 암세포 치료)
  Mouse -> Controller : treat(row, column)
  activate Controller
  Controller -> Cancer : treat(row, column)  [synchronized(lock)]
  Cancer --> Controller : 치료 횟수가 남아 있으면 true
  opt 치료함
    Controller -> Listener : boardChanged(EDITED)
  end
  deactivate Controller
end
deactivate Mouse

Listener -> Listener : repaint()
note right of Listener : EDITED → 전체 다시 그리기 요청\n(GENERATION이면 refreshNow 부분 갱신)

... Swing이 다시 그릴 때 ...
Listener -> Renderer : redraw(outermostCell, g, bounds, drawAll = true)
@enduml
